{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#card-zh","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 是面向 DSH Web 的 Android 手机测试插件，在侧边栏提供手机面板，并向 agent 注册手机操作工具。它通过 WebSocket 连接用户配置的 Android Agent，可管理设备、查看连接状态、打开应用、点击和滑动屏幕、输入文字、发送按键、截取屏幕并读取无障碍 UI 树；还可按界面文字或 resourceId 定位控件并执行点击或输入。适合需要从 DSH 面板或 agent 流程操作 Android 应用、进行移动端测试的用户。使用前需在手机运行配套 Agent，并配置其 WebSocket 地址和 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:51-53","src/index.ts:73-79","src/tools.ts:655-671","src/client/panel/PhonePanel.tsx:59-80"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#card-en","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-android-agent connects an Android Agent to DSH Web over WebSocket. Its sidebar and agent tools open apps, tap, swipe, enter text, send keys, capture screenshots, and inspect the accessibility tree. Find controls by text or resourceId. A companion Agent, WebSocket address, and token are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:51-53","src/index.ts:73-79","src/tools.ts:655-671","src/client/panel/PhonePanel.tsx:59-80"]}
