{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#feature-1","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 的功能「设备管理与连接」：在 DSH 手机面板登记设备别名、WebSocket 地址和 token，查看设备连接状态，并发起连接或断开。设备信息由插件存储，连接引擎按设备维护 WebSocket。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/store.ts:56-80","src/engine.ts:229-300"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#feature-2","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 的功能「手机操作」：面板或 agent 工具可按应用包名打开 App，并通过坐标点击、输入文本、滑动和 Android 按键执行交互。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:169-195","src/tools.ts:197-325"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#feature-3","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 的功能「读取界面并定位控件」：获取 Android 无障碍 UI 树，可按文本或 resourceId 查找节点，再根据节点边界点击或聚焦输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:370-400","src/tools.ts:412-601"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#feature-4","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 的功能「截图」：通过手机 Agent 请求 JPEG 或 PNG 屏幕图像；agent 截图工具会把图片写入主机的 ~/.dsh/phone-screenshots 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:327-368","src/engine.ts:229-300"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#feature-5","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 的功能「agent 手机工具」：向 DSH 注册 phone_list、phone_rpc 等工具，让 agent 查看已配置设备并调用手机操作；工具与 Web 面板使用同一设备引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:84-129","src/tools.ts:655-671"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#caveat-1","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 使用前须知：需要另行在 Android 手机上运行配套 Agent，并在面板提供其 WebSocket 地址和 token，插件再通过该连接请求手机操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/store.ts:56-79"]}
{"unit_id":"ravenli059__dsh-android-agent#caveat-2","repo":"ravenli059/dsh-android-agent","commit":"6fe5edbb54659ec1ad717b2c2934cd7b616746a5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-android-agent 使用前须知：手机文字输入依赖 Agent 的 inputText 能力，插件支持先按坐标或无障碍控件聚焦输入框再提交文字。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:227-259"]}
